msgstr "Gagal / perlu ditinjau"

msgid "HMTG “GEA” ITB — Committee"
msgstr "HMTG “GEA” ITB — Panitia"

msgid "Authenticator device"
msgstr "Perangkat autentikator"

msgid "Authentication code"
msgstr "Kode autentikasi"

msgid "Skip to content"
msgstr "Langsung ke konten"

msgid "Main navigation"
msgstr "Navigasi utama"

msgid "Results"
msgstr "Hasil"

msgid "Committee"
msgstr "Panitia"

msgid "My ballot"
msgstr "Surat suara saya"

msgid "Log out"
msgstr "Keluar"

msgid "Language"
msgstr "Bahasa"

msgid "Apply"
msgstr "Terapkan"

msgid "All election times are in WIB (UTC+7)."
msgstr "Seluruh waktu pemilu menggunakan WIB (UTC+7)."

msgid "Committee access"
msgstr "Akses panitia"

msgid "Ketua Himpunan & Senator"
msgstr "Ketua Himpunan & Senator"

msgid "Two offices. One final choice for each."
msgstr "Dua jabatan. Satu pilihan final untuk masing-masing."

msgid "View results"
msgstr "Lihat hasil"

msgid "Open my ballot"
msgstr "Buka surat suara saya"

msgid "Voter login"
msgstr "Masuk sebagai pemilih"

msgid "The committee is preparing the election. Please check back later."
msgstr "Panitia sedang menyiapkan pemilu. Silakan kembali nanti."

msgid "How to vote"
msgstr "Cara memilih"

msgid "Log in with your NIM and the password sent to your approved ITB email."
msgstr ""
"Masuk menggunakan NIM dan password yang dikirim ke email ITB terdaftar Anda."

msgid ""
"Select a candidate, review your choice, and confirm for each office "
"separately."
msgstr ""
"Pilih kandidat, periksa pilihan, lalu konfirmasikan setiap jabatan secara "
"terpisah."

msgid ""
"Check your receipt. You can return to vote for your remaining office before "
"closing."
msgstr ""
"Periksa bukti suara Anda. Anda dapat kembali memilih jabatan lainnya sebelum"
" penutupan."

msgid "Ballot privacy"
msgstr "Privasi surat suara"

msgid ""
"Your choices are linked to your NIM. Authorized committee reviewers can "
"review them after closing. Keep your password private. Each submitted vote "
"is final."
msgstr ""
"Pilihan Anda terhubung dengan NIM. Peninjau panitia yang berwenang dapat "
"meninjaunya setelah pemilu berakhir. Rahasiakan password Anda. Setiap suara "
"yang dikirim bersifat final."

msgid "Opens"
msgstr "Dibuka"

msgid "Closes"
msgstr "Ditutup"

msgid "Status"
msgstr "Status"

msgid "Voting open"
msgstr "Pemungutan suara dibuka"

msgid "Voting closed"
msgstr "Pemungutan suara ditutup"

msgid "Voting paused"
msgstr "Pemungutan suara dijeda"

msgid "Not open yet"
msgstr "Belum dibuka"

msgid "Submitted"
msgstr "Sudah dikirim"

msgid "Not submitted"
msgstr "Belum dikirim"

msgid "View receipt"
msgstr "Lihat bukti suara"

msgid "Choose candidate"
msgstr "Pilih kandidat"

msgid "Choose one candidate"
msgstr "Pilih satu kandidat"

msgid "Nothing is submitted until you confirm on the next screen."
msgstr "Suara belum dikirim sebelum Anda mengonfirmasi di halaman berikutnya."

msgid "Your choice"
msgstr "Pilihan Anda"

msgid "Review choice"
msgstr "Periksa pilihan"

msgid "Confirm your choice"
msgstr "Konfirmasi pilihan Anda"

msgid "This vote is final."
msgstr "Suara ini bersifat final."

msgid "After submitting, you cannot change or delete this choice."
msgstr "Setelah dikirim, pilihan ini tidak dapat diubah atau dihapus."

msgid "Confirm and submit vote"
msgstr "Konfirmasi dan kirim suara"

msgid "Change selection"
msgstr "Ubah pilihan"

msgid "Vote received"
msgstr "Suara diterima"

msgid "Submitted successfully"
msgstr "Berhasil dikirim"

msgid "Office"
msgstr "Jabatan"

msgid "Candidate"
msgstr "Kandidat"

msgid "Submitted at"
msgstr "Waktu pengiriman"

msgid "Receipt ID"
msgstr "ID bukti suara"

msgid "This receipt confirms your saved vote. Keep it private."
msgstr ""
"Bukti ini mengonfirmasi bahwa suara Anda tersimpan. Rahasiakan bukti ini."

msgid "You still have an unsubmitted office:"
msgstr "Anda masih memiliki jabatan yang belum dipilih:"

msgid "Return to my ballot"
msgstr "Kembali ke surat suara saya"

msgid "Election results"
msgstr "Hasil pemilu"

msgid ""
"Final totals after voting closed. Individual voter identities are not "
"published."
msgstr ""
"Rekapitulasi final setelah pemilu berakhir. Identitas pemilih tidak "
"dipublikasikan."

msgid "eligible voters"
msgstr "pemilih terdaftar"

msgid "turnout"
msgstr "partisipasi"

msgid "Votes"
msgstr "Suara"

msgid "The totals are tied. The committee will apply the election rules."
msgstr "Perolehan suara seri. Panitia akan menerapkan peraturan pemilu."

msgid "Candidate totals will be available automatically after voting closes."
msgstr ""
"Perolehan suara kandidat akan tersedia otomatis setelah pemungutan suara "
"ditutup."

msgid "NIM"
msgstr "NIM"

msgid "Approved ITB email"
msgstr "Email ITB terdaftar"

msgid "CSV has unexpected extra columns."
msgstr "CSV memiliki kolom tambahan yang tidak sesuai."

msgid "The CSV is malformed."
msgstr "Format CSV tidak valid."

msgid "Use your NIM and the password sent to your approved ITB email."
msgstr "Gunakan NIM dan password yang dikirim ke email ITB terdaftar Anda."

msgid "Log in"
msgstr "Masuk"

msgid "Forgot your password?"
msgstr "Lupa password?"

msgid "Reset password"
msgstr "Pulihkan password"

msgid ""
"Enter your approved ITB email address. We will send a recovery link if it is"
" eligible."
msgstr ""
"Masukkan email ITB terdaftar Anda. Kami akan mengirim tautan pemulihan jika "
"alamat memenuhi syarat."

msgid "Send recovery link"
msgstr "Kirim tautan pemulihan"

msgid "Check your email"
msgstr "Periksa email Anda"

msgid ""
"If the address is eligible, a recovery link will arrive shortly. Check your "
"spam folder too."
msgstr ""
"Jika alamat memenuhi syarat, tautan pemulihan akan segera dikirim. Periksa "
"juga folder spam."

msgid "Set a new password"
msgstr "Buat password baru"

msgid "Save password"
msgstr "Simpan password"

msgid "This recovery link is invalid or has expired."
msgstr "Tautan pemulihan ini tidak valid atau sudah kedaluwarsa."

msgid "Request another link"
msgstr "Minta tautan baru"

msgid "Password updated"
msgstr "Password diperbarui"

msgid "Your submitted votes are unchanged. Log in with your new password."
msgstr ""
"Suara yang telah dikirim tidak berubah. Masuk menggunakan password baru "
"Anda."

msgid "Election operations"
msgstr "Operasional pemilu"

msgid "Election configuration"
msgstr "Konfigurasi pemilu"

msgid "Import voter CSV"
msgstr "Impor CSV pemilih"

msgid "Turnout"
msgstr "Partisipasi"

msgid "submitted"
msgstr "suara terkirim"

msgid "Activate and freeze configuration"
msgstr "Aktifkan dan kunci konfigurasi"

msgid "Queue unsent credentials"
msgstr "Antrekan kredensial yang belum dibuat"

msgid "Resume voting"
msgstr "Lanjutkan pemungutan suara"

msgid "Pause voting"
msgstr "Jeda pemungutan suara"

msgid "Export results"
msgstr "Ekspor hasil"

msgid "Export audit log"
msgstr "Ekspor log audit"

msgid "Export identity-linked ballots"
msgstr "Ekspor surat suara beserta identitas"

msgid "Create the election and candidates in configuration first."
msgstr "Buat pemilu dan kandidat di halaman konfigurasi terlebih dahulu."

msgid "Email delivery"
msgstr "Pengiriman email"

msgid ""
"Sent means accepted by the provider; check delivery and bounce events "
"separately."
msgstr ""
"Terkirim berarti diterima penyedia email; periksa status diterima atau "
"ditolak secara terpisah."

msgid "No deliveries queued."
msgstr "Belum ada email dalam antrean."

msgid "Attempts"
msgstr "Percobaan"

msgid "View delivery records"
msgstr "Lihat catatan pengiriman"

msgid "Voter access"
msgstr "Akses pemilih"

msgid ""
"Revoking access prevents future submissions and preserves existing votes."
msgstr ""
"Pencabutan akses mencegah pengiriman suara baru dan tetap mempertahankan "
"suara yang sudah tersimpan."

msgid "Manage voter access"
msgstr "Kelola akses pemilih"

msgid "Access"
msgstr "Akses"

msgid "Revoke access"
msgstr "Cabut akses"

msgid "Revoked"
msgstr "Dicabut"

msgid "Approved voter CSV"
msgstr "CSV daftar pemilih tetap"

msgid "CSV must be smaller than 1 MB."
msgstr "Ukuran CSV harus kurang dari 1 MB."

msgid ""
"Required columns: nim,email. Optional column: display_name. Review the list "
"before confirming."
msgstr ""
"Kolom wajib: nim,email. Kolom opsional: display_name. Periksa daftar sebelum"
" mengonfirmasi."

msgid "voters ready to import"
msgstr "pemilih siap diimpor"

msgid "Name"
msgstr "Nama"

msgid "Confirm import"
msgstr "Konfirmasi impor"

msgid "Preview CSV"
msgstr "Pratinjau CSV"

msgid "Access unavailable"
msgstr "Akses tidak tersedia"

msgid ""
"This action is not available to your account or at this stage of the "
"election."
msgstr ""
"Tindakan ini tidak tersedia untuk akun Anda atau pada tahap pemilu ini."

msgid "Return home"
msgstr "Kembali ke beranda"

msgid "Page not found"
msgstr "Halaman tidak ditemukan"

msgid "Please try again"
msgstr "Silakan coba lagi"

msgid ""
"We could not complete this request. Check your ballot status before retrying"
" a submission."
msgstr ""
"Permintaan belum dapat diselesaikan. Periksa status surat suara sebelum "
"mencoba mengirim kembali."

msgid "The election is already activated."
msgstr "Pemilu sudah diaktifkan."

msgid "Set a future opening time before activating."
msgstr "Atur waktu pembukaan di masa mendatang sebelum mengaktifkan."

msgid "Configure both offices before activating."
msgstr "Siapkan kedua jabatan sebelum mengaktifkan."

msgid "Each office must have exactly two candidates."
msgstr "Setiap jabatan harus memiliki tepat dua kandidat."

msgid "Import the approved voter list first."
msgstr "Impor daftar pemilih tetap terlebih dahulu."

msgid "Only an activated, unfinished election can be paused or resumed."
msgstr ""
"Hanya pemilu aktif yang belum berakhir yang dapat dijeda atau dilanjutkan."

msgid "You are not eligible to vote."
msgstr "Anda tidak memenuhi syarat sebagai pemilih."

msgid "Invalid office."
msgstr "Jabatan tidak valid."

msgid "Voting is not open."
msgstr "Pemungutan suara sedang tidak dibuka."

msgid "Invalid candidate for this office."
msgstr "Kandidat tidak valid untuk jabatan ini."

msgid "Upload a UTF-8 CSV file."
msgstr "Unggah berkas CSV dengan format UTF-8."

msgid "CSV must contain nim and email columns."
msgstr "CSV harus memiliki kolom nim dan email."

msgid "CSV exceeds 10,000 voters."
msgstr "CSV melebihi batas 10.000 pemilih."

#, python-format
msgid "Invalid NIM or display name on CSV line %(line)s."
msgstr "NIM atau nama tidak valid pada baris CSV %(line)s."

#, python-format
msgid "Invalid email on CSV line %(line)s."
msgstr "Email tidak valid pada baris CSV %(line)s."

msgid "Email domain is not an approved ITB domain."
msgstr "Domain email bukan domain ITB yang diizinkan."

msgid "Duplicate NIM or email in the CSV."
msgstr "Ada NIM atau email duplikat dalam CSV."

msgid "The CSV is empty."
msgstr "CSV kosong."

msgid "A NIM or email already exists. Import only new voters."
msgstr "NIM atau email sudah terdaftar. Impor hanya pemilih baru."

msgid "The activated voter list is frozen."
msgstr "Daftar pemilih yang sudah diaktifkan telah dikunci."

msgid "Activate the election before issuing credentials."
msgstr "Aktifkan pemilu sebelum membuat kredensial."

msgid "Too many attempts. Try again in five minutes."
msgstr "Terlalu banyak percobaan. Coba lagi dalam lima menit."

msgid "Preview the CSV again before importing."
msgstr "Pratinjau CSV kembali sebelum mengimpor."

#, python-format
msgid "Imported %(count)s voters."
msgstr "Berhasil mengimpor %(count)s pemilih."

#, python-format
msgid "Queued %(count)s credential emails."
msgstr "Sebanyak %(count)s email kredensial masuk antrean."

msgid "Credential generation is queued. Check delivery status shortly."
msgstr ""
"Pembuatan kredensial masuk antrean. Periksa status pengiriman sesaat lagi."

msgid "Invalid voter."
msgstr "Pemilih tidak valid."

msgid "Exports are available after closing."
msgstr "Ekspor tersedia setelah pemilu berakhir."

msgid "Closes in"
msgstr "Ditutup dalam"

msgid "Opens in"
msgstr "Dibuka dalam"

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Batal"

msgid ""
"This freezes the voter list, candidates, and schedule. It cannot be undone."
msgstr ""
"Ini mengunci daftar pemilih, kandidat, dan jadwal. Tindakan ini tidak dapat "
"dibatalkan."

msgid ""
"Credential emails go to every voter who has not received them. This cannot "
"be undone."
msgstr ""
"Email kredensial dikirim ke setiap pemilih yang belum menerimanya. Tindakan "
"ini tidak dapat dibatalkan."

msgid "About us"
msgstr "Tentang kami"

msgid "Helpdesk"
msgstr "Helpdesk"

msgid "Need help? Contact the helpdesk"
msgstr "Butuh bantuan? Hubungi helpdesk"

msgid "Election committee"
msgstr "Panitia pemilu"

msgid ""
"The committee prepares, runs, and safeguards the Ketua Himpunan and Senator "
"election."
msgstr ""
"Panitia menyiapkan, menjalankan, dan menjaga Pemilu Ketua Himpunan dan "
"Senator."

msgid "Committee chair"
msgstr "Ketua panitia"

msgid ""
"Having trouble logging in or voting? Scan the QR code or contact the "
"committee directly."
msgstr ""
"Kesulitan masuk atau memilih? Pindai kode QR atau hubungi panitia secara "
"langsung."

msgid "Helpdesk QR code"
msgstr "Kode QR helpdesk"

msgid "Scan with your phone camera to reach the helpdesk."
msgstr "Pindai dengan kamera ponsel untuk menghubungi helpdesk."

msgid "Contact person"
msgstr "Narahubung"

msgid "Call"
msgstr "Telepon"

msgid "Common problems"
msgstr "Kendala umum"

msgid "Haven't received your login credentials?"
msgstr "Belum menerima kredensial login?"

msgid ""
"Credentials are sent to your approved ITB email. Check your spam or "
"promotions folder first, then contact us with your NIM and full name."
msgstr ""
"Kredensial dikirim ke email ITB yang terdaftar. Periksa folder spam atau "
"promosi terlebih dahulu, lalu hubungi kami dengan NIM dan nama lengkap."

msgid "Request a new one on the"
msgstr "Minta yang baru melalui"

msgid "password reset page"
msgstr "halaman reset password"

msgid "The link goes to your approved ITB email."
msgstr "Tautan dikirim ke email ITB yang terdaftar."

msgid "Your NIM is not recognised?"
msgstr "NIM tidak dikenali?"

msgid ""
"You may not be on the voter roll yet. Contact us with your NIM, full name, "
"and ITB email so the committee can check."
msgstr ""
"Anda mungkin belum terdaftar sebagai pemilih. Hubungi kami dengan NIM, nama "
"lengkap, dan email ITB agar panitia dapat memeriksanya."

msgid "Something went wrong while voting?"
msgstr "Ada masalah saat memilih?"

msgid ""
"Do not submit again. Contact us and include your receipt code if you "
"received one."
msgstr ""
"Jangan mengirim ulang. Hubungi kami dan sertakan kode tanda terima jika "
"sudah menerimanya."

msgid "The committee will never ask for your password."
msgstr "Panitia tidak akan pernah meminta password Anda."

msgid "Contact us"
msgstr "Hubungi kami"

msgid "Not sure which email is approved?"
msgstr "Tidak yakin email mana yang terdaftar?"

msgid "Still no email after a few minutes?"
msgstr "Email belum masuk setelah beberapa menit?"

msgid "Contact the helpdesk"
msgstr "Hubungi helpdesk"

msgid "Having trouble with your ballot?"
msgstr "Ada kendala dengan surat suara?"
